msgstr "<small><b>API key</b>: Issue it and set up billing at console.anthropic.com. Most reliable.<br><b>Claude sign-in</b>: Uses your subscription account without a console key — click the <b>[Claude Sign In]</b> button above to auto-install the Anthropic CLI if needed and <b>sign in via the browser</b> (no terminal needed).<br><b>Note</b>: Translation (Messages API) requires <b>API credits</b> — a Claude subscription (Pro/Max) doesn't cover API usage, so add credits at console.anthropic.com → Billing. Be careful when sending sensitive documents.</small>"

